# English blog posts live at the site root (/<slug>/), while Hindi and Marathi
# use a /blogs/ prefix. Anyone inferring the English URL from the hi/mr pattern
# lands on /blogs/<slug>/ and 404s. Send them to the real page.
# Uses a :placeholder, NOT a splat: Cloudflare follows redirects even when a
# real asset matches, so /blogs/* would hijack the /blogs/ index page itself.
/blogs/:slug/ /:slug/ 301
/blogs/:slug /:slug/ 301

